---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="CircuitBot — AI Game Generator | Turn Ideas into Playable Games" description="Describe a game in plain language and get a playable Godot 4 executable with AI-generated art, code, and full source. First game free.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <img src="/circuitbot.png" alt="CircuitBot AI game generator mascot" class="hero-mascot" />
        <span class="badge badge-yellow">CircuitBot - Workshop Assistant</span>
        <h1>
          Imagine a Game.<br>
          <span style="color: var(--accent-yellow);">We Will Build It Together.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">
          Describe the game you have always wanted to make. <span style="color: #4582c7;">CircuitBot</span> builds it with
          <span style="color: #4582c7;">Godot 4</span> — complete with art, code, and a playable build. The perfect starting
          point for your game dev journey.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
          <a href="/create" class="btn btn-yellow btn-lg">Build Your First Game Free</a>
          <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-lg">See How It Works</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-free-note">No credit card required. First game on us.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="terminal hero-terminal">
        <div class="terminal-bar">
          <span class="terminal-dot red"></span>
          <span class="terminal-dot yellow"></span>
          <span class="terminal-dot green"></span>
          <span class="terminal-title"><span style="color: #4582c7;">CircuitBot</span> &mdash; Building Your Game</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-body">
          <div class="term-line line-1"><span class="prompt">&gt; </span><span class="cmd typewriter">A retro pixel-art roguelike dungeon crawler with procedural levels</span></div>
          <div class="term-line line-2">
            <span class="output">Planning your game...</span>
          </div>
          <div class="term-line line-3">
            <span class="highlight">Generating pixel art assets...</span>
          </div>
          <div class="term-line line-4">
            <span class="highlight">Implementing 4 game systems...</span>
          </div>
          <div class="term-line line-5">
            <span class="output">Exporting executable...</span>
          </div>
          <div class="term-line line-6">
            <span class="success">&#10004; Your game is ready! Time to make it your own.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- Community Games -->
  <section class="section" id="community-games">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Community <span class="gradient-text">Games</span></h2>
        <p>See what others have built with CircuitBot.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="community-grid" id="community-grid"></div>
      <p class="community-empty" id="community-empty" style="display:none;">No games yet — be the first to build one!</p>
      <div class="community-cta">
        <a href="/create" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Build Your Own</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- How It Works -->
  <section class="section" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>How It <span class="gradient-text">Works</span></h2>
        <p>Three steps from idea to playable game.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card step-card">
          <span class="step-number">1</span>
          <h3>&#9997;&#65039; Describe Your Game</h3>
          <p>Write a few sentences about the game you want. Genre, mechanics, art style — whatever you imagine.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card step-card">
          <span class="step-number">2</span>
          <h3>&#9889; We Build It</h3>
          <p>Our AI plans the architecture, generates art, writes <span style="color: #4582c7;">GDScript</span>, and compiles everything in <span style="color: #4582c7;">Godot 4</span>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card step-card">
          <span class="step-number">3</span>
          <h3>&#127918; Play &amp; Learn</h3>
          <p>Get a compiled executable and the full <span style="color: #4582c7;">Godot</span> source. Play it, study the code, then make it even better.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- What's Inside Your Game -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>What Is Inside <span class="gradient-text">Your Game</span></h2>
        <p>Every generated game comes with real, editable source code you can learn from.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card feature-card">
          <h3><span class="feature-icon">&#127912;</span> Custom Art Assets</h3>
          <p>AI-generated sprites, textures, and backgrounds that match your game's visual style.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card feature-card">
          <h3><span class="feature-icon">&#128187;</span> Real Game Code</h3>
          <p>Complete <span style="color: #4582c7;">GDScript</span> you can read and learn from — player movement, enemies, scoring, and more.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card feature-card">
          <h3><span class="feature-icon">&#127760;</span> UI &amp; Menus</h3>
          <p>Title screens, HUD, health bars, and score displays — all properly structured in <span style="color: #4582c7;">Godot</span> scenes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card feature-card">
          <h3><span class="feature-icon">&#128736;</span> Scene Architecture</h3>
          <p>Properly organized <span style="color: #4582c7;">Godot</span> project with correct node hierarchies you can study and extend.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card feature-card">
          <h3><span class="feature-icon">&#127916;</span> Input Handling</h3>
          <p>Keyboard and controller mappings pre-configured for your game's mechanics.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card feature-card">
          <h3><span class="feature-icon">&#128640;</span> Playable Build</h3>
          <p>A compiled Windows .exe ready to share with friends — no engine installation needed to play.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- Pricing -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="text-align: center;">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Simple <span class="gradient-text">Pricing</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="pricing-grid pricing-grid-3">
        <div class="card pricing-card pricing-free">
          <span class="pricing-badge">Free</span>
          <div class="pricing-amount">$0</div>
          <div class="pricing-label">first game</div>
          <ul class="pricing-features">
            <li>Full <span style="color: #4582c7;">Godot 4</span> project</li>
            <li>AI-generated art assets</li>
            <li>Compiled Windows executable</li>
            <li>Just verify your phone number</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/create" class="btn btn-yellow btn-lg">Build Free</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card pricing-card pricing-promo">
          <span class="pricing-badge pricing-badge-promo">Limited Promo</span>
          <div class="pricing-original"><s>$12.99</s></div>
          <div class="pricing-amount pricing-paid">$6.99</div>
          <div class="pricing-label">per game</div>
          <ul class="pricing-features">
            <li>Everything in free tier</li>
            <li>Unlimited games</li>
            <li>No restrictions on output</li>
            <li>Delivered in ~15-30 minutes</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/create" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Create a Game</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card pricing-card">
          <span class="pricing-save">Save 10% + 1 free game</span>
          <div class="pricing-amount pricing-paid">$59.99</div>
          <div class="pricing-label">10-pack bundle</div>
          <ul class="pricing-features">
            <li>11 games for the price of 9</li>
            <li>Everything in per-game tier</li>
            <li>Use them any time</li>
            <li>Best value for builders</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/create" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get the Bundle</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="section" id="faq">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Common <span class="gradient-text">Questions</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Is the first game really free?</summary>
          <p>Yes. Verify your phone number and generate one complete game at no cost. No credit card required. Same quality, same output as paid games.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can I edit the game after?</summary>
          <p>Absolutely! You receive the complete <span style="color: #4582c7;">Godot</span> project. Open it in the <span style="color: #4582c7;">Godot</span> editor and modify anything — that is the whole idea. Build on what <span style="color: #4582c7;">CircuitBot</span> gives you.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How long does generation take?</summary>
          <p>Most games are ready in 15-30 minutes, depending on complexity.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What engine is used?</summary>
          <p><span style="color: #4582c7;">Godot 4</span> — open source, no license fees, huge learning community. You get the full source project to learn from.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Do I need to know how to code?</summary>
          <p>Not at all! <span style="color: #4582c7;">CircuitBot</span> generates the game for you. But if you want to learn, you will have real working code to study and experiment with.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What if generation fails?</summary>
          <p>If we cannot produce a working game, you will receive a full refund. No questions asked.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- Now It's Your Turn! -->
  <section class="section your-turn-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="your-turn-inner">
        <div class="your-turn-glow"></div>
        <img src="/circuitbot.png" alt="CircuitBot" class="your-turn-mascot" />
        <h2 class="your-turn-heading">Now It Is <span class="gradient-text-warm">Your Turn!</span></h2>
        <p class="your-turn-text">
          Your generated game is a real <span style="color: #4582c7;">Godot 4</span> project — not a black box.
          Open it up, explore the code, tweak things, break things, and learn by doing.
          That is how every great game developer starts.
        </p>

        <div class="your-turn-cards">
          <a href="/create" class="your-turn-card">
            <div class="ytc-icon">&#9889;</div>
            <div class="ytc-label">Start Here</div>
            <div class="ytc-desc">Generate your first game for free</div>
          </a>
          <a href="https://godotengine.org/download/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="your-turn-card">
            <div class="ytc-icon">&#128230;</div>
            <div class="ytc-label">Get <span style="color: #4582c7;">Godot</span> Engine</div>
            <div class="ytc-desc">Free &amp; open source game engine</div>
          </a>
          <a href="https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/getting_started/introduction/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="your-turn-card">
            <div class="ytc-icon">&#128218;</div>
            <div class="ytc-label">Learn <span style="color: #4582c7;">Godot</span></div>
            <div class="ytc-desc">Official tutorials &amp; documentation</div>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="your-turn-quote">
          "The best way to learn game dev is to start with something that works — then make it your own."
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Structured Data -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "CircuitBot",
    "url": "https://circuit-bot.com",
    "logo": "https://circuit-bot.com/circuitbot.png",
    "description": "AI-powered game generator that turns text descriptions into playable Godot 4 games with art, code, and compiled builds.",
    "sameAs": ["https://discord.gg/circuitbot"]
  })} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "name": "CircuitBot",
    "url": "https://circuit-bot.com"
  })} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Is the first game really free?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Verify your phone number and generate one complete game at no cost. No credit card required. Same quality, same output as paid games." }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can I edit the game after?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Absolutely! You receive the complete Godot project. Open it in the Godot editor and modify anything — that is the whole idea. Build on what CircuitBot gives you." }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How long does generation take?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Most games are ready in 15-30 minutes, depending on complexity." }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What engine is used?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Godot 4 — open source, no license fees, huge learning community. You get the full source project to learn from." }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do I need to know how to code?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Not at all! CircuitBot generates the game for you. But if you want to learn, you will have real working code to study and experiment with." }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What if generation fails?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "If we cannot produce a working game, you will receive a full refund. No questions asked." }
      }
    ]
  })} />

  <script is:inline>
    (function() {
      var API_BASE = window.location.hostname === 'localhost'
        ? 'http://localhost:8000'
        : 'https://circuitbot-api-production.up.railway.app';

      var grid = document.getElementById('community-grid');
      var empty = document.getElementById('community-empty');
      if (!grid) return;

      fetch(API_BASE + '/api/browse?limit=6')
        .then(function(r) { return r.json(); })
        .then(function(games) {
          if (!games || !games.length) {
            if (empty) empty.style.display = '';
            return;
          }

          // Fetch thumbnails in parallel, then render
          var thumbPromises = games.map(function(game) {
            if (!game.thumbnail_key) return Promise.resolve();
            return fetch(API_BASE + '/api/browse/' + game.id + '/thumbnail')
              .then(function(r) { return r.json(); })
              .then(function(d) { game._thumb = d.thumbnail_url; })
              .catch(function() {});
          });

          Promise.all(thumbPromises).then(function() {
            games.forEach(function(game) {
              var title = game.game_title || game.prompt.substring(0, 50);
              var creator = game.creator_username ? 'by ' + game.creator_username : '';
              var thumb = game._thumb || '/circuitbot.png';

              var card = document.createElement('a');
              card.href = '/play?id=' + game.id;
              card.className = 'community-card';
              card.innerHTML =
                '<div class="cc-thumb-wrap">' +
                  '<img src="' + thumb + '" alt="" class="cc-thumb" loading="lazy" />' +
                '</div>' +
                '<div class="cc-info">' +
                  '<div class="cc-title">' + title.replace(/</g, '&lt;') + '</div>' +
                  (creator ? '<div class="cc-creator">' + creator.replace(/</g, '&lt;') + '</div>' : '') +
                '</div>';
              grid.appendChild(card);
            });
          });
        })
        .catch(function() {
          if (empty) empty.style.display = '';
        });
    })();
  </script>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* ── Hero ──────────────────────────────────── */
  .hero {
    padding-top: 48px;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .hero-content {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .hero-mascot {
    width: 104px;
    height: 104px;
    object-fit: contain;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin: 0 auto 20px;
    animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 52px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 16px 0;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 18px);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 580px;
    margin: 0 auto 32px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .hero-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-buttons .btn:first-child {
    font-size: 18px;
    padding: 16px 36px;
  }

  .hero-free-note {
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .hero-terminal {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ── Terminal typewriter animation ─────────── */
  .term-line {
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .line-1 { animation: appear 0.3s 0.5s forwards; }
  .line-2 { animation: appear 0.3s 1.8s forwards; }
  .line-3 { animation: appear 0.3s 2.8s forwards; }
  .line-4 { animation: appear 0.3s 3.8s forwards; }
  .line-5 { animation: appear 0.3s 4.8s forwards; }
  .line-6 { animation: appear 0.4s 5.8s forwards; }

  @keyframes appear {
    from { opacity: 0; visibility: visible; transform: translateY(4px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .typewriter {
    display: inline-block;
    overflow: hidden;
    white-space: nowrap;
    vertical-align: bottom;
    border-right: 2px solid var(--accent-blue);
    width: 0;
    animation:
      typing 1.0s 0.5s steps(40) forwards,
      blink 0.6s 0.5s step-end 3;
  }

  @keyframes typing {
    from { width: 0; }
    to   { width: 100%; }
  }

  @keyframes blink {
    50% { border-color: transparent; }
  }

  /* ── Step cards ────────────────────────────── */
  .step-card {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 36px 24px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .step-icon {
    display: block;
    font-size: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .step-number {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    background: rgba(69, 130, 199, 0.1);
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    line-height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .step-card h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .step-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ── Feature cards ─────────────────────────── */
  .feature-card {
    padding: 28px 24px;
  }

  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 22px;
    vertical-align: middle;
    margin-right: 4px;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ── Pricing cards ─────────────────────────── */
  .pricing-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .pricing-grid-3 {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    max-width: 960px;
  }

  .pricing-card {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 24px;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .pricing-card .pricing-features {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .pricing-card .btn {
    width: 100%;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .pricing-free {
    border-color: var(--accent-yellow);
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255, 211, 64, 0.06);
  }

  .pricing-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -1px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--accent-yellow);
    color: var(--bg-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    padding: 4px 20px;
    border-radius: 0 0 var(--radius) var(--radius);
  }

  .pricing-amount {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 52px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent-yellow);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .pricing-paid {
    color: var(--accent-blue);
  }

  .pricing-promo {
    border-color: var(--accent-blue);
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(69, 130, 199, 0.06);
  }

  .pricing-badge-promo {
    background: var(--accent-blue);
  }

  .pricing-original {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 8px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .pricing-promo .pricing-amount {
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .pricing-save {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-yellow);
    margin-top: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  /* Bundle card gets a visible border */
  .pricing-card:last-child {
    border-color: var(--border-bright);
  }

  .pricing-label {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .pricing-features {
    list-style: none;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .pricing-features li {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    padding: 5px 0;
  }

  .pricing-features li::before {
    content: "\2713 ";
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    margin-right: 8px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .pricing-free .pricing-features li::before {
    color: var(--accent-yellow);
  }

  .pricing-card .btn {
    width: 100%;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  /* ── FAQ ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .faq-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .faq-item {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
  }

  .faq-item:hover,
  .faq-item[open] {
    border-color: var(--border-bright);
  }

  .faq-item summary {
    padding: 18px 24px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    user-select: none;
